          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "*9. ABCD is a trapezium with parallel sides AD = 3 cm and BC = 5 cm. E and F are the midpoints of the non-parallel sides. Find the ratio of the areas of the 4-gons AEFD and EBCF."
            }
          ]
